[# manifest_tip_header.j2 — TIP callout above a ticket link.
   Sets reviewer expectations and provides one-click ticket access.

   GOTCHA: GitHub callouts ([!TIP] etc.) render styled ONLY outside <details>.
   Inside <details>, they show as plain quoted text. See rules/callout-gotcha.md.

   Variables expected in scope:
     tip_text:        body of the TIP callout (string; may be multi-line)
     ticket_link_md:  full markdown link, pre-formatted (e.g. '[ABC-123](https://...)')

   Inline form:
     [[ 'TIP' | gh_callout('Backwards-compatible schema change. No downstream rebuild required.') ]]

     **Ticket:** [ABC-123](https://example.atlassian.net/browse/ABC-123)
#]

[[ 'TIP' | gh_callout(tip_text) ]]

**Ticket:** [[ ticket_link_md ]]
